pical delivery</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">Depends on the local rail</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Hours</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">Set by each local rail</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Fund with</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">USD, EUR, GBP, USDC, USDT</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">ZAR account</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\"><a href=\"/open-a-zar-account\">Available →</a></span></div></div></div></section>\n<div style=\"background:#F6F4EF\">\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px);\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Payout rails in South Africa.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:26px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:200px\"><span style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/flags/za.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:30px;height:21px;border-radius:3px;object-fit:cover;flex:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(19,17,38,.08)\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#F6F4EF;color:#4C4A66\">Bank</span></span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:auto 0 0\">Bank EFT</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#4C4A66;margin:0\">Electronic funds transfer to any South African bank account.</p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A\">Account number + bank</span></div><a href=\"/stablecoins\" style=\"padding:26px;border-radius:24px;background:#131126;color:#F6F4EF;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-height:200px\" class=\"dp-1uxoczp\"><span style=\"display:flex;gap:6px\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">USDC</span><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#131126;font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">USDT</span></span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px, 0.9vw + 20px, 34px);line-height:1.05;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.025em;margin:auto 0 0\">Stablecoin funded</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#B4B1D0;margin:0\">Send digital dollars, deliver ZAR on any rail above.</p></a></div></section><section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px);\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px, 1.9vw + 23px, 52px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">How to send money to South Africa.<